    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT MORE GAMES</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br><br><br><br>ASMR - Autonomous Sensory Meridian Response, is a pleasant tingling sensation around the head, neck and shoulders that occurs as a result of exposure to a specific stimulus - triggers. Typically, the triggers for this type of reaction are visual, tactile, or auditory sensations. In ASMR Food Experience, we will focus on combining two types of stimulus: sound and visual!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/00eb69fe7d8a047e67ab60a99676be49.poster.avif?t=1717747066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/00eb69fe7d8a047e67ab60a99676be49.webm?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/00eb69fe7d8a047e67ab60a99676be49.mp4?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Run your own restaurant!</strong></h2>In the ASMR Food Experience, you play the role of the owner of a small restaurant. Some of your tasks in this simulator will be customer service. You will have to take care of proper deliveries, clean, take care of the herbarium and maintain the restaurant in the best condition. This will make a huge difference in the overall rating of your establishment, so you will increase interest, restaurant turnout and tips from guests.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/6ec0149e3816b0e672dec59b8e5ef2e4.poster.avif?t=1717747066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/6ec0149e3816b0e672dec59b8e5ef2e4.webm?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/6ec0149e3816b0e672dec59b8e5ef2e4.mp4?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Decorate and personalize</strong></h2>Your restaurant, your rule - would you like to have an Asian-style style? Or are you more interested in Mediterranean decor? Our simulator will allow you to run the business that best suits your taste. Decorate walls, change tables and arrange matching accessories inside and outside your restaurant! Over time, it will be more and more popular among customers, so you need to consider expanding your restaurant.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/b7e93b473736d1cc238e48030c5399bb.poster.avif?t=1717747066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/b7e93b473736d1cc238e48030c5399bb.webm?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/b7e93b473736d1cc238e48030c5399bb.mp4?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Omnipresent sounds</strong></h2>There will be tons of sounds in the ASMR Food Experience to help you experience the most desirable reactions - calmness, excitement, stress relief, and more. In the game, you will have full control over what sounds are in it: nature, cooking, cleaning, conversations or street sounds. Find something for yourself in this amazing simulator!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/879d967d115e4e61542ef10a54ae163f.poster.avif?t=1717747066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/879d967d115e4e61542ef10a54ae163f.webm?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/879d967d115e4e61542ef10a54ae163f.mp4?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
