_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/6ec0149e3816b0e672dec59b8e5ef2e4.mp4?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Decorate and personalize</strong></h2>Your restaurant, your rule - would you like to have an Asian-style style? Or are you more interested in Mediterranean decor? Our simulator will allow you to run the business that best suits your taste. Decorate walls, change tables and arrange matching accessories inside and outside your restaurant! Over time, it will be more and more popular among customers, so you need to consider expanding your restaurant.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/b7e93b473736d1cc238e48030c5399bb.poster.avif?t=1717747066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/b7e93b473736d1cc238e48030c5399bb.webm?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/b7e93b473736d1cc238e48030c5399bb.mp4?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Omnipresent sounds</strong></h2>There will be tons of sounds in the ASMR Food Experience to help you experience the most desirable reactions - calmness, excitement, stress relief, and more. In the game, you will have full control over what sounds are in it: nature, cooking, cleaning, conversations or street sounds. Find something for yourself in this amazing simulator!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/879d967d115e4e61542ef10a54ae163f.poster.avif?t=1717747066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/879d967d115e4e61542ef10a54ae163f.webm?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2066740/extras/879d967d115e4e61542ef10a54ae163f.mp4?t=1717747066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
